   142	The `legacy_unmanaged` bucket exists so an unmanaged spawn path must be declared
   143	rather than pass silently. It is asserted empty — `provider-execution-inventory-contract.ts`
   144	requires that no surface carries it — so adding one is a deliberate, reviewable
   145	act that fails the contract until justified. It is not a claim that unmanaged
   146	execution is impossible, only that none is currently admitted.
